<ul style=3D"line-height:150%"></ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
22px;">The suit that protects workers from dangerous electricity</span><br>=
<br>Some of our favorite startup innovations are those that make workers sa=
fer: for example, the robot that <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/C=
tc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVmNnY80HdhdW8PB3834nCfLQW3NdgT55JV6l7N3NdJGs2-ZW0W6N1vH=
Y6lZ3nZVQk1V46H2JSlW5-kDt_7M2YfCW7TyjHb4-q5W0W8lr4Kz881zjnW3MZfvm9d3WvfW49t=
HhJ6VpCk7W4G74v22wPMbGW657C5H2n-Ny3W4jtlpC9hsLLXW7jB5jb6gG1ZHW3kFrxs5fl_XrW=
4ghMSx4wDr7SW2lxf7-5zLqSpN5jmVf8j_zm6W2K-V2T33ShkgVDVT3g9g8nRnW4WJh1b995kn7=
N17VzgfgQ9MxW9cmJnS5-7rN0W8blTnb4qd572W6cPq5V5w_JmPN7Q_LyTb4nwcf90T4kP04" s=
tyle=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"bd4R6O3B=
" target=3D"_blank">tamps down grain</a> in silos, or the one that <a href=
=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVmNnY80HdhdW8PB3834n=
CfLQW3NdgT55JV6l7N3NdJGM2-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3mDW3RjfGG32mKfzW5zCfDz4P6KHjW7H58sr=
7V9k3yW5nrB7l5kFQJPW6VHqGf2GmJpCW8_D6ll2GzWk_W8p3YnL1341p9W5frB3s6_T6pTW4Zw=
mzb29_H-TW1l_XZv2z65LnW2y257Y2PWWh2W73jK8T4W4CbkW5ftYwy8Qqz1yW260BD13dksc9W=
1nGnG915M1nJW4Wlbnk8HhpBWW7B9mHf2SHDWZW8czHHw25SyhNW7Mt3pB8WDbVMN5pjyVg4JR0=
gW1YSpwL5_FmpVW2Z44YJ1PNM85W6pZXxZ8c2_P7N5XR2MCbmWYLf4j6Pz-04" style=3D"col=
or:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"1JBuul+X" target=3D=
"_blank">paints lines</a> on roads. They offer a practical solution to some=
 of the most dangerous, yet necessary work humans perform.&nbsp;<br><br></p=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Power-line work is one of those risky jobs. T=
hough the industry adheres to practices meant to safeguard workers from dan=
gerous currents, fatal accidents can still occur. <br><br>One of the bigges=
t hazards is induction:&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">That=E2=80=99s when a worker comes into contact with a=
 line or piece of equipment that isn=E2=80=99t supposed to be energized but=
 has become so due to nearby electric or magnetic fields, resulting in shoc=
ks, injury, or death.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">There were <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ct=
c/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVmNnY80HdhdW8PB3834nCfLQW3NdgT55JV6l7N3NdJFT2-ZW0W5BW0B0=
6lZ3l1W2T4gd54qjG4_W5CsmWD6Th4TCW2CWXsW88fY1pW6WnNrq7y5pd4W59gJgn39x29XW55T=
M-n3VYHN-W3VD0Ms4ddWN5W1Y5ypQ7qZ22ZW7Km9bJ896DgZW3yR3WL5hkHrJW3wmWML9fvJMJW=
3d1xp66swLfsW8xnsLn10sdHYW5Gq0N65DmV7vW8svZlg3q9ZJ-W76QT0S7YfZgpW8Wrd8d8BVg=
ZrW4v695k6YXrpZd6kMnW04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data=
-hs-link-id-v2=3D"R67ky4xj" target=3D"_blank">81 induction accidents</a> in=
 the US between 1985 and 2021, resulting in 60 deaths, per US Bureau of Lab=
or Statistics data.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But Eduardo Ramirez Bettoni, who helped devel=
op a suit that protects workers and who now works for a power-distribution =
equipment firm, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf0=
4/VVmNnY80HdhdW8PB3834nCfLQW3NdgT55JV6l7N3NdJG82-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3kxW2Q_-pG5Rb=
TvvW3DrZpz6z3SVcW5jCDjH7vxHlzW7ZbY9N5Fq0H5W9fR9003rXYFBW4tF2pC5pN84SW38bDfj=
1xFJBSW8BxhKt2YKv3gW5CGk9z5zB-zbW7jtX7v4d6wSnW3l8wjT5KYkKyW6D6t5q8WTjQ0W6dm=
Ydq5CywKNW6Tky921rnLdlN19GJpHMPm56W5hWmlZ3TGLW6VrFNm-5mJJ-dW6zLzbK41Hp_MW4d=
LjDD1HsP6SW3nhr6F4FYH1jf3-WFCs04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=
=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"8UJkW/nZ" target=3D"_blank">told</a> <span sty=
le=3D"font-style: italic;">IEEE Spectrum </span>that he believes there are =
hundreds of induction contacts every year in the US alone. <br><br>He also =
suspects incidents are increasing as grid operators attempt to boost capaci=
ty. <br><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;">About this =
suit=E2=80=A6 </span><br><br>It comes from <a  href=3D"https://media.hubspo=
t.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVmNnY80HdhdW8PB3834nCfLQW3NdgT55JV6l7N3NdJFz=
2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3p4W6BNXcD79Mp5hW3xxYlG3937C1W2F4Lcl6snQcKV3K7f490fvr5VlSRXd=
7d7NDmW2148Dc4mC-49N2HZpgnW6w7MW6NQz454TMjccW5bT0HW7HR4WDW5PHtxr7mrl_YN4CFf=
RK_P3SwW4zVRGN8-D7_WW6Hzsfj77XTSFW5_bpr-2pLdDcN9lT-13kdxHWVClV_93vV53cf7RXK=
F404" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"D=
FRI0qCZ" target=3D"_blank">Electrostatics</a>, a Budapest startup that make=
s&nbsp;jumpsuits (complete with gloves and socks) to protect workers.&nbsp;=
</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">How they work:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">The suits are made with conductive materials, but also=
 have low-resistance conductive straps through which current can flow out. =
<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">They=E2=80=99re flame retardant and insulated to prote=
ct against heat. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">They keep exposure below the <a href=3D"https://media.=
